{"id":"n35269-1-11","stage":1,"title":"규칙 · 规则","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35269-1-11-1","ko":"이 게임은 하면 할수록 점점 재미있는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得这个游戏玩得越多，就越有趣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"게임은","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게임은","audio":"/audio/d9cf83882979e4b0cbec.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"할수록","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ수록：表示程度随之变化：“越……越……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할수록","audio":"/audio/f26c45ab9d2222b73abe.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있는","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있는","audio":"/audio/f963495a3d81a4c95b50.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/564aca8a9fafeb304157.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n35269-1-11-2","ko":"나는 규칙이 너무 복잡해서 잘 못하겠던데.","zh":"我觉得规则太复杂了，根本玩不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"규칙이","meaning":"规则，规定，条例","explanation":"규칙：规则，规定，条例；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"규칙","audio":"/audio/c689d4077c924169b4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35269","senseId":"1","lemma":"규칙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"규칙이","audio":"/audio/0757c83770e8629077ed.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"복잡해서","meaning":"复杂，繁杂，混乱","explanation":"복잡하다：复杂，繁杂，混乱；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"복잡하다","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66274","senseId":"1","lemma":"복잡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복잡해서","audio":"/audio/cc2bab4c20d2f4ff5e2d.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"못하겠던데.","meaning":"不会","explanation":"못하다：不会；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못하겠던데","audio":"/audio/c83164d4e2ac8aa024ef.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c689d4077c924169","term":"규칙","zh":"规则，规定，条例","audio":"/audio/c689d4077c924169b4a4.mp3","entryId":"35269","definition":"规定出来供大家共同遵守的制度。","pronunciation":["규칙"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"810e6e796e934ade","term":"복잡하다","zh":"复杂，繁杂，混乱","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3","entryId":"66274","definition":"事情、情感等错综复杂，难以理清。","pronunciation":["복짜파다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不会","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做某事做不到一定水准或没有做此事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/872539c8ec8bdcebc707.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.68,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=35269","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4053,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得这个游戏玩得越多，就越有趣。","我觉得规则太复杂了，根本玩不好。","从现在开始十年后，我们会变成什么样呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得这个游戏玩得越多，就越有趣。","我觉得规则太复杂了，根本玩不好。","从现在开始十年后，我们会变成什么样呢？"],"answer":1}]}
